# Deploy Flow (har code change ke baad)

Jab bhi agent koi code change kare, reply ke END mein ye 3 steps IS ORDER mein do (jo apply ho):

## 1. Code push (hamesha)

```bash
cd "/Users/gurpreetchauhan/Desktop/Adhikari Pay"
git add -A
git commit -m "<short message>"
git push
```

- Commit message: human-style, no AI attribution (see adhikaripay-core rule).
- User Mac Terminal mein khud chalayega — agent shell mein mat chalao (jab tak user na bole).

## 2. Deploy + env (agar backend/web change hua)

- Coolify env vars mein kya add/change karna hai — exact `KEY=value` list do.
- Phir bolo: Coolify pe **backend** (ya web) redeploy karo.
- Deploy ke baad agar seed/migrate chahiye to uski command bhi do.

## 3. APK rebuild + install (sirf agar mobile app change hua)

Build aur install — DONO commands hamesha saath do:

```bash
# Build release APK
cd "/Users/gurpreetchauhan/Desktop/Adhikari Pay/apps/adhikaripay-mobile-app/android"
./gradlew assembleRelease

# Install on phone (USB on)
adb install -r app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk
```

- APK path: `app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk`
- Backend-only change ho to clearly bolo: "APK rebuild ki zaroorat nahi".
